	text: [
		"A §6Mana Pool§r can §6hold§r a large amount of mana to be used for all kinds of things. ",
		"",
		"To §6transfer§r the mana from the generating flower into the pool, a §6Mana Spreader§r is required. ",
		"",
		"Place the Mana Spreader §6near§r the generating flowers. ",
		"",
		"Use the §6Wand of the Forest§r to §6sneak right-click§r the §6flower§r, then §6sneak-right click§r the §6spreader§r to link them. ",
		"",
		"In the same way, §6link§r the §6spreader§r to the placed down §6mana pool§r.",
		"",
		"Placing flowers §6after§r placing the spreader will §6automatically§r §6link§r the flower to the spreader, as long as they are within range. "
	],
